    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1641770/extras/f63ea03131f3334de9f53581fc57efe9.poster.avif?t=1742294720\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1641770/extras/f63ea03131f3334de9f53581fc57efe9.webm?t=1742294720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1641770/extras/f63ea03131f3334de9f53581fc57efe9.mp4?t=1742294720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A thrilling 2D platformer where the chase is on\u2014and the nuts must flow!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After saving the world from aliens, our squirrel hero is ready to relax\u2014until a <i>very</i> angry bear steals his precious nuts and bolts into the wilderness! Chase the thief across <strong>four vibrant 2D worlds</strong>, each with unique obstacles, enemies, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump, push boxes and run through <strong>action-packed 2D levels</strong>, outsmart the bear\u2019s crafty allies, and recover every last nut. Can you catch the bear and teach him a lesson?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Unique  Worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging 2D Platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crafty Enemies with Unique Skills</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1641770/extras/f63ea03131f3334de9f53581fc57efe9.poster.avif?t=1742294720\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1641770/extras/f63ea03131f3334de9f53581fc57efe9.webm?t=1742294720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1641770/extras/f63ea03131f3334de9f53581fc57efe9.mp4?t=1742294720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A thrilling 2D platformer where the chase is on\u2014and the nuts must flow!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After saving the world from aliens, our squirrel hero is ready to relax\u2014until a <i>very</i> angry bear steals his precious nuts and bolts into the wilderness! Chase the thief across <strong>four vibrant 2D worlds</strong>, each with unique obstacles, enemies, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump, push boxes and run through <strong>action-packed 2D levels</strong>, outsmart the bear\u2019s crafty allies, and recover every last nut. Can you catch the bear and teach him a lesson?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Unique  Worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging 2D Platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crafty Enemies with Unique Skills</p></li></ul>",
